#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:4
msgid "v2.6.9"
msgstr "v2.6.9"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:6
msgid ""
"v2.6.9 adds OpenMV Pure Thermal and Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense support, fixes"
" byte-swapped RGB565 framebuffer colors and Python auto-indentation, and "
"refines the firmware-upgrade prompt and documentation tooltips. It is built "
"on the same Qt Creator 4.0.2 base as the previous release, and there are no "
"breaking changes to existing projects."
msgstr ""
"v2.6.9 lägger till stöd för OpenMV Pure Thermal och Arduino Nano 33 BLE "
"Sense, åtgärdar byteväxlade RGB565-bildbuffertfärger och Pythons automatiska"
" indentering, och förfinar uppmaningen om fast programvara-uppgradering samt"
" dokumentationstipsen. Den är byggd på samma Qt Creator 4.0.2-bas som "
"föregående utgåva, och det finns inga brytande ändringar för befintliga "
"projekt."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "På den här sidan"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Höjdpunkter"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:20
msgid ""
"**OpenMV Pure Thermal** (``OPENMVPT``) is now supported, with bundled "
"firmware, bootloader, and UVC binaries plus a DFU flashing entry."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV Pure Thermal** (\\ ``OPENMVPT``\\ ) stöds nu, med medföljande fast "
"programvara, startladdare och UVC-binärer plus en post för DFU-flashning."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense** support adds bundled firmware and a full set "
"of board, sensor, Bluetooth, audio, and thermal-camera examples."
msgstr ""
"**Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense**\\ -stöd lägger till medföljande fast "
"programvara och en komplett uppsättning exempel för kort, sensorer, "
"Bluetooth, ljud och termisk kamera."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Fixed byte-swapped RGB565 colors** in the live framebuffer view and video "
"transcoder."
msgstr ""
"**Åtgärdade byteväxlade RGB565-färger** i live-bildbuffertvyn och "
"videoomkodaren."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Fixed Python auto-indentation** so a new empty line keeps the previous "
"line's indent instead of resetting to column 0."
msgstr ""
"**Åtgärdade Pythons automatiska indentering** så att en ny tom rad behåller "
"föregående rads indentering istället för att återställas till kolumn 0."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:28
msgid ""
"**\"Don't show this message again\"** checkbox on the firmware-out-of-date "
"upgrade prompt suppresses repeated nags."
msgstr ""
"Kryssrutan **\"Visa inte detta meddelande igen\"** på uppmaningen om "
"uppgradering vid föråldrad fast programvara dämpar upprepade påminnelser."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:32
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nya funktioner"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:34
msgid ""
"**OpenMV Pure Thermal:** added support for the ``OPENMVPT`` camera (OpenMV "
"Pure Thermal, STM32H743 with SDRAM), including bundled firmware, bootloader,"
" and UVC binaries and a new ``boards.txt`` entry for DFU flashing "
"(`c5b7df59f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c5b7df59f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV Pure Thermal:** lade till stöd för kameran ``OPENMVPT`` (OpenMV "
"Pure Thermal, STM32H743 med SDRAM), inklusive medföljande fast programvara, "
"startladdare och UVC-binärer samt en ny post i ``boards.txt`` för DFU-"
"flashning (\\ `c5b7df59f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c5b7df59f>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense:** bundled the Nano 33 BLE Sense firmware "
"(`c5b7df59f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c5b7df59f>`__) and "
"added a full set of examples covering the board I2C scanner, the APDS9960, "
"HTS221, LPS22, and LSM9DS1 sensors, BLE blinky/scan/temperature, audio FFT, "
"and the thermal camera (`4e7bc157b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/4e7bc157b>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense:** inkluderade den fasta programvaran för Nano "
"33 BLE Sense (\\ `c5b7df59f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c5b7df59f>`__\\ ) och lade till en komplett uppsättning "
"exempel som täcker kortets I2C-skanner, sensorerna APDS9960, HTS221, LPS22 "
"och LSM9DS1, BLE blinky/scan/temperature, ljud-FFT och den termiska kameran "
"(\\ `4e7bc157b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/4e7bc157b>`__\\ "
")."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:46
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Övriga ändringar och förbättringar"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:48
msgid ""
"The firmware-out-of-date upgrade prompt now includes a **\"Don't show this "
"message again\"** checkbox so users can suppress repeated upgrade prompts "
"(`dd1ad68c4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/dd1ad68c4>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Uppmaningen om uppgradering vid föråldrad fast programvara innehåller nu en "
"kryssruta **\"Visa inte detta meddelande igen\"** så att användare kan dämpa"
" upprepade uppgraderingsuppmaningar (\\ `dd1ad68c4 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/dd1ad68c4>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:51
msgid ""
"Ctrl-clicking a method or attribute now shows only the documentation tooltip"
" for that specific module, by filtering matches to the module name preceding"
" the ``.`` (`34d9a30bf <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/34d9a30bf>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Ctrl-klick på en metod eller ett attribut visar nu endast "
"dokumentationstipset för just den modulen, genom att filtrera matchningar "
"mot modulnamnet som föregår ``.`` (\\ `34d9a30bf "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/34d9a30bf>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:55
msgid ""
"Examples submenu labels now display hyphens in folder names as spaces for "
"cleaner titles (for example ``Nano 33 BLE Sense`` and ``Portenta H7``) "
"(`34d9a30bf <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/34d9a30bf>`__, "
"`4e7bc157b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/4e7bc157b>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Etiketter i undermenyn Examples visar nu bindestreck i mappnamn som "
"mellanslag för renare titlar (till exempel ``Nano 33 BLE Sense`` och "
"``Portenta H7``\\ ) (\\ `34d9a30bf <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/34d9a30bf>`__\\ , `4e7bc157b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/4e7bc157b>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:59
msgid ""
"On Linux, the **DFU Util** and **Convert Video** progress dialogs now open "
"without stealing window focus (`dd1ad68c4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/dd1ad68c4>`__)."
msgstr ""
"På Linux öppnas nu förloppsdialogerna **DFU Util** och **Convert Video** "
"utan att stjäla fönsterfokus (\\ `dd1ad68c4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/dd1ad68c4>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:62
msgid ""
"The **TV Shield** example was updated to use SIF (352x240) resolution, "
"optional triple buffering, and an FPS printout, and now notes that a wired "
"TV shield is also supported; the same change also tidied the Portenta H7 "
"LoRa example by dropping the explicit OTAA join timeout argument (`d54bb97e4"
" <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d54bb97e4>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Exemplet **TV Shield** uppdaterades till att använda SIF-upplösning "
"(352x240), valfri trippelbuffring och en FPS-utskrift, och påpekar nu att en"
" kabelansluten TV-shield också stöds; samma ändring städade även upp "
"Portenta H7 LoRa-exemplet genom att ta bort det explicita argumentet för "
"OTAA-anslutningstidsgräns (\\ `d54bb97e4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d54bb97e4>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:69
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Felrättningar"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:71
msgid ""
"Fixed RGB565 framebuffer colors appearing byte-swapped: images from older "
"firmware (before 3.8.0) are byte-reversed while newer firmware is sent non-"
"reversed, in both the live view and the video transcoder (`dd1ad68c4 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/dd1ad68c4>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Åtgärdade RGB565-bildbuffertfärger som visades byteväxlade: bilder från "
"äldre fast programvara (före 3.8.0) är bytevända medan nyare fast "
"programvara skickas icke-vänd, både i live-vyn och i videoomkodaren (\\ "
"`dd1ad68c4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/dd1ad68c4>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:75
msgid ""
"Fixed incorrect Python auto-indentation by keeping the previous line's "
"indent on the new empty line instead of resetting to column 0 after a blank "
"line (`c33e9f354 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c33e9f354>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Åtgärdade felaktig automatisk Python-indentering genom att behålla "
"föregående rads indentering på den nya tomma raden istället för att "
"återställa till kolumn 0 efter en tom rad (\\ `c33e9f354 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c33e9f354>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:78
msgid ""
"Error-message click navigation no longer tries to open a nonexistent source "
"file when the error originates from a built-in (frozen) module, avoiding "
"spurious editor errors (`dd1ad68c4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/dd1ad68c4>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Klicknavigering i felmeddelanden försöker inte längre öppna en obefintlig "
"källfil när felet härrör från en inbyggd (frusen) modul, vilket undviker "
"oönskade redigerarfel (\\ `dd1ad68c4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/dd1ad68c4>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:84
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "Plattforms- och verktygsstöd"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:86
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 4.0.2."
msgstr "**Qt Creator-bas:** 4.0.2."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:87
msgid ""
"**New board:** OpenMV Pure Thermal (``OPENMVPT``, STM32H743 with SDRAM) with"
" bundled firmware, bootloader, and UVC binaries (`c5b7df59f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c5b7df59f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Nytt kort:** OpenMV Pure Thermal (\\ ``OPENMVPT``\\ , STM32H743 med SDRAM)"
" med medföljande fast programvara, startladdare och UVC-binärer (\\ "
"`c5b7df59f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c5b7df59f>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:90
msgid ""
"**New board:** Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense with bundled firmware (`c5b7df59f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c5b7df59f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Nytt kort:** Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense med medföljande fast programvara "
"(\\ `c5b7df59f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c5b7df59f>`__\\ "
")."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:92
msgid ""
"**Bundled firmware:** OpenMV firmware updated 3.8.0 to 3.9.1 (`c5b7df59f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c5b7df59f>`__) and then to "
"3.9.2 (`a707f6ebc <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a707f6ebc>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Medföljande fast programvara:** OpenMV-firmware uppdaterad från 3.8.0 till"
" 3.9.1 (\\ `c5b7df59f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c5b7df59f>`__\\ ) och därefter till 3.9.2 (\\ `a707f6ebc "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a707f6ebc>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:96
msgid ""
"**IDE version:** bumped from 2.6.8 to 2.6.9 (`d128254d7 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d128254d7>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**IDE-version:** höjd från 2.6.8 till 2.6.9 (\\ `d128254d7 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d128254d7>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:100
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "Brytande ändringar"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.9.rst:102
msgid ""
"None. This release adds boards and fixes without changing existing project "
"behavior, and the Qt Creator 4.0.2 base is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Inga. Den här utgåvan lägger till kort och åtgärdar fel utan att ändra "
"befintligt projektbeteende, och Qt Creator 4.0.2-basen är oförändrad."
